{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14371","headline":"赋得生刍一束 · 于结","name":"赋得生刍一束","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"比玉人应重，爲刍物自轻。\n向风倾弱叶，裛露示纤茎。\n蒨练宜春景，芊绵对雨情。\n每慙苹藻用，多谢𦶜兰荣\n孺子才虽远，公孙策未行。\n谘询如不弃，终冀及微生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}